{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"Take care and have a good rest, Bo.\"\nRoy turns to  Orphy and whispers. \"Hey when did he learn to do that?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:45:30.500000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141082243227668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"'I can imagine... to be fair, flight does sound fun.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:46:05.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141228293070868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"`Uh. No idea. Lots of yous change a lot in this city, I don't actually keep track. You are what you are now and apparently Mister Bo can fly.`","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:46:38.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141368634507264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"'Change is inevitable. We just have to adapt to make it turn out as well as we can.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:47:02.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141468630904883","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"'I... can't say my old form was better than this, but I do miss it occasionally. Mostly with all the things alive people have to deal with.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:47:28.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141578634891265","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"'How are you supposed to have time to think if you have to sleep for eight hours?'","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:47:49.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141666895659019","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"Roy shrugs. \"I suppose so. Some folks back home can hover on their swarms for a moment, but it's nowhere near like that. A pity this ring ended up only letting me fall slower rather than fly outright.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:48:02.282000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141718863052820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"'The closest I'm likely going to get to flight is if someone just... throws me around. It wouldn't be difficult.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:48:50.720000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877141922026754068","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"`Hm. You're small enough. Won't be hard to convince the Miss to give you a ride on her back. She did it with Mr. Nolan before.`","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:49:24.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877142064230465616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"'...she'd do that? What could I do in return?'","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:50:17.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877142287107391538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"`Stick around, do something that makes you happy when she's around. She's a simple one. The wisdom behind it's complicated, probably not even there. Now, game booths?`","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:51:39.292000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877142629068984341","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
