{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"He didn't try to fly all the way to the port, right? I can't imagine doing that without wings. But as long as he's safe, that's good. Perhaps we can go to the booths and Irynx and Kukudh can catch us there?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:55:19.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877143554076606484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
